{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0001", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have a headache.", "chosen": "У меня болит голова.", "rejected": "Я имею боль головы.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - literal calque from English produces unnatural Russian; dative impersonal required]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0002", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She caught a cold.", "chosen": "Она простудилась.", "rejected": "Она поймала холод.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - verb+object calque ignores Russian reflexive verb простудиться]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0003", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He got better.", "chosen": "Ему стало лучше.", "rejected": "Он получил лучше.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - received better is not a Russian construction; dative impersonal required]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0004", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I feel dizzy.", "chosen": "У меня кружится голова.", "rejected": "Я чувствую себя головокружительным.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - головокружительный means thrilling not dizzy; кружится голова is the correct idiom]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0005", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "My throat hurts.", "chosen": "У меня болит горло.", "rejected": "Моё горло болеет.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - болеет requires animate subject; горло takes болит in third-person impersonal]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0006", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Take the pills twice a day.", "chosen": "Принимайте таблетки два раза в день.", "rejected": "Принимайте таблетки двух разов в день.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - двух разов is an incorrect genitive form; два раза is required after cardinal два]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0007", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The doctor examined the patient.", "chosen": "Врач осмотрел пациента.", "rejected": "Доктор осматривал пациента.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - осматривал is imperfective implying repeated action; осмотрел is the correct perfective for a completed examination]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0008", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I'm not feeling well.", "chosen": "Мне нехорошо.", "rejected": "Я испытываю неудовлетворительное самочувствие.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - bureaucratic phrasing is wrong register for a conversational complaint about feeling ill]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0009", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Call an ambulance!", "chosen": "Вызовите скорую!", "rejected": "Немедленно инициируйте вызов бригады скорой медицинской помощи!", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - formal administrative phrasing is unsuitable for an emergency imperative]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0010", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I need to see a doctor.", "chosen": "Мне нужно к врачу.", "rejected": "Я вынужден обратиться за профессиональной медицинской помощью.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - formal written register replaces natural colloquial need-to-visit construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0011", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He's under the weather.", "chosen": "Ему нездоровится.", "rejected": "Он под погодой.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - под погодой is not a Russian idiom; the idiomatic equivalent is нездоровится]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0012", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The medicine worked wonders.", "chosen": "Лекарство очень помогло.", "rejected": "Лекарство сделало чудеса.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - сделало чудеса is a literal calque; worked wonders requires a sense-equivalent phrase]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0013", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He's got a sweet tooth.", "chosen": "Он сладкоежка.", "rejected": "Он имеет сладкий зуб.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - сладкий зуб does not exist in Russian; the lexicalized noun сладкоежка is required]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0014", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "My doctor is very sympathetic.", "chosen": "Мой врач очень понимающий.", "rejected": "Мой врач очень симпатичный.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - симпатичный means attractive not empathetic; понимающий is the correct equivalent]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0015", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have a chronic condition.", "chosen": "У меня хроническое заболевание.", "rejected": "У меня хроническое кондиционирование.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - кондиционирование means air conditioning; medical condition maps to заболевание or состояние]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0016", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have a sore throat and a high fever.", "chosen": "У меня болит горло и высокая температура.", "rejected": "У меня болит горло.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - high fever is omitted making the translation medically incomplete]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0017", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Take these tablets every morning after breakfast.", "chosen": "Принимайте эти таблетки каждое утро после завтрака.", "rejected": "Принимайте таблетки каждое утро.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - after breakfast timing is omitted which changes dosage adherence information]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0018", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Drink plenty of water and get plenty of rest.", "chosen": "Пейте много воды и как следует отдыхайте.", "rejected": "Пейте много воды.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - rest instruction is omitted removing half the medical advice]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0019", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I need to take my medicine.", "chosen": "Мне нужно принять лекарство.", "rejected": "Мне нужно взять лекарство.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - взять means to take physically not to take medicine; принять is the correct verb for medication intake]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0020", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The wound is healing well.", "chosen": "Рана хорошо заживает.", "rejected": "Рана хорошо лечится.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - лечится means is being treated not is healing; заживать is the verb for wound healing]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0021", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He has high blood pressure.", "chosen": "У него высокое давление.", "rejected": "Он имеет высокое давление крови.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - он имеет is a literal calque; Russian uses у него with the noun without a verb]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0022", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She broke her leg.", "chosen": "Она сломала ногу.", "rejected": "Она повредила ногу.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - повредить means to damage or injure generally not to break a bone; сломать is the correct verb for a fracture]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "repair_note": "replaced свою ногу (valid possessive) with повредила ногу (wrong verb for fracture)"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0023", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have an allergy to peanuts.", "chosen": "У меня аллергия на арахис.", "rejected": "Я имею аллергию к арахису.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - я имею is non-native and preposition к is wrong; на is required for Russian allergy construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0024", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The fever has gone down.", "chosen": "Температура спала.", "rejected": "Лихорадка пошла вниз.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - пошла вниз is a directional calque; спасть with температура is the natural Russian form]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0025", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He needs surgery.", "chosen": "Ему нужна операция.", "rejected": "Ему нужна хирургия.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - хирургия means surgery as a field not a procedure; операция is the correct term for a surgical procedure]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0026", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She is recovering from the flu.", "chosen": "Она выздоравливает после гриппа.", "rejected": "Она восстанавливается от гриппа.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - восстанавливаться от is used for physical damage not illness; выздоравливать is the medical recovery verb]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0027", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Take a deep breath.", "chosen": "Дышите глубже.", "rejected": "Возьмите глубокий вдох.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - возьмите глубокий вдох is a calque; the natural form is дышите глубже or сделайте глубокий вдох]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0028", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I sprained my ankle.", "chosen": "Я подвернул лодыжку.", "rejected": "Я растянул свою лодыжку.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - растянуть means to stretch not to sprain; подвернуть is the correct Russian verb for ankle sprain]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0029", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She has a skin rash.", "chosen": "У неё кожная сыпь.", "rejected": "Она имеет кожную сыпь.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - она имеет is a literal calque; у неё is the natural Russian possessive construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0030", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The patient is in stable condition.", "chosen": "Состояние пациента стабильное.", "rejected": "Пациент находится в стабильном кондиционировании.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - кондиционирование means air conditioning not condition; состояние is the correct medical term]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0031", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I'm allergic to penicillin.", "chosen": "У меня аллергия на пенициллин.", "rejected": "Я аллергичен к пенициллину.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - аллергичен к is an unusual construction; у меня аллергия на is standard for medical allergy statements]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0032", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He has a bad back.", "chosen": "У него болит спина.", "rejected": "У него плохая спина.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - плохая спина is a literal translation; bad back as chronic pain maps to у него болит спина]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0033", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She needs to lose weight.", "chosen": "Ей нужно похудеть.", "rejected": "Ей нужно потерять вес.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - потерять вес is a calque; the natural Russian verb for losing weight is похудеть]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0034", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I twisted my knee.", "chosen": "Я подвернул колено.", "rejected": "Я скрутил своё колено.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - скрутил means wrung not sprained; подвернуть is correct for joint twisting injuries]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0035", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The bandage needs to be changed.", "chosen": "Нужно сменить повязку.", "rejected": "Бандаж нуждается в изменении.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - бандаж in Russian refers to a medical brace not a wound bandage; повязка is correct for dressings]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0036", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "I have a headache, nausea, and sensitivity to light.", "chosen": "У меня головная боль, тошнота и светочувствительность.", "rejected": "У меня головная боль.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - nausea and photosensitivity are omitted reducing a multi-symptom description to a single symptom]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0037", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "She takes three different medications every day for her condition.", "chosen": "Она принимает три разных препарата каждый день от своего заболевания.", "rejected": "Она принимает лекарства каждый день.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - three different and for her condition are omitted changing the clinical specificity]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0038", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "The doctor prescribed both antibiotics and painkillers after the surgery.", "chosen": "Врач назначил антибиотики и обезболивающие после операции.", "rejected": "Врач назначил антибиотики после операции.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - painkillers is omitted changing a two-drug post-surgical prescription to one drug]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0039", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "Wash your hands thoroughly with soap and warm water before eating.", "chosen": "Тщательно мойте руки с мылом и тёплой водой перед едой.", "rejected": "Мойте руки перед едой.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - thoroughly with soap and warm water are omitted removing hygiene specificity from a medical instruction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0040", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "The test results showed high cholesterol levels and low vitamin D.", "chosen": "Результаты анализов показали высокий холестерин и низкий уровень витамина D.", "rejected": "Результаты анализов показали высокий холестерин.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - low vitamin D result is omitted making the lab report incomplete]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0041", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Anna works for the Red Cross.", "chosen": "Анна работает в Красном Кресте.", "rejected": "Анна работает для Красного Пересечения.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - Red Cross is a proper name; it must be rendered as Красный Крест not literally translated as Красное Пересечение]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0042", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "The World Health Organization published its report.", "chosen": "Всемирная организация здравоохранения опубликовала свой доклад.", "rejected": "Мировая организация здоровья опубликовала свой репорт.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - WHO has an established Russian name; здоровья and репорт are incorrect renderings]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0043", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Dr. Petrov is a well-known cardiologist.", "chosen": "Доктор Петров — известный кардиолог.", "rejected": "Доктор Петров является хорошо известным кардиологом.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - является хорошо известным is formal written; dash construction with predicate adjective is more natural]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0044", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Maria was admitted to City Hospital Number One.", "chosen": "Марию госпитализировали в Первую городскую больницу.", "rejected": "Мария была впущена в Городскую Больницу Номер Один.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - Городскую Больницу Номер Один is a calque; Russian convention uses ordinal Первую городскую больницу]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0045", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Professor Sokolov lectures at the Medical Academy.", "chosen": "Профессор Соколов читает лекции в Медицинской академии.", "rejected": "Профессор Соколов лектирует в Медицинской Академии.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - лектирует is not a Russian word; читает лекции is correct; академии is lowercase after a proper name]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0046", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Please rest and drink plenty of fluids.", "chosen": "Пожалуйста, отдыхайте и пейте много жидкости.", "rejected": "Пожалуйста, отдохните и выпейте воды.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - fluids is narrowed to water only; the instruction to rest is weakened from rest properly to take a short break]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "omission_variant", "repair_note": "replaced copied English source with Russian omission variant; both chosen and rejected are now Cyrillic"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0047", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She has diabetes.", "chosen": "У неё диабет.", "rejected": "Диабет — это хроническое заболевание обмена веществ при котором организм не вырабатывает достаточно инсулина.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - encyclopedic explanation of the condition replaces the translation of the clinical statement]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "explanation_instead_of_translation"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0048", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I feel sick today.", "chosen": "Мне сегодня плохо.", "rejected": "Мне sick today.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - English words are left untranslated in a Russian output producing mixed-language text]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "mixed_language"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0049", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The prescription must be filled today.", "chosen": "Рецепт нужно выкупить сегодня.", "rejected": "Рецепт нужно заполнить сегодня.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - заполнить means to fill in a form not to fill a prescription; выкупить or получить по рецепту is correct for dispensing medication]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "repair_note": "replaced copied English source with Russian wrong_word_choice variant; both sides now Cyrillic"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-0050", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He has a broken arm.", "chosen": "У него сломана рука.", "rejected": "Рука — это часть тела. В данном случае речь идёт о травме при которой кость повреждена.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - encyclopedic explanation of what an arm is replaces the translation of the clinical statement]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "explanation_instead_of_translation"}
